      "execution": "Direct shared native normalization steps registered as MCP tools; hub subprocess preflight is not part of this expanded source graph. Writes obey service read-only policy and declared output roots. Invalid argparse exits become tool errors retaining exit status; other native exceptions abort the sequence.",
